{"sourceUrl":"https://genetics.cas.cn/edu/zsxx/xlytms/202504/t20250424_7611154.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:00.886818+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://genetics.cas.cn/edu/zsxx/xlytms/202504/t20250424_7611154.html","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<h1>\n                    中国科学院遗传发育所2025年“筑梦科学”大学生夏令营活动报名通知\n                </h1>\n<div>\n<div>\n<span>发布时间：2025-04-24</span>\n<span>\n                                        【 \n                                        <a>小</a>\n<a>中</a>\n<a>大</a>\n                                         】\n                                    </span>\n<a href=\"https://genetics.cas.cn/edu/zsxx/xlytms/202504/t20250424_7611154.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【打印】</a>\n<a href=\"https://genetics.cas.cn/edu/zsxx/xlytms/202504/t20250424_7611154.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【关闭】</a>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div><p><span><span><span><span>中国科学院遗传与发育生物学研究所（简称：遗传发育所）最早成立于</span></span></span></span><span><span>1959</span></span><span><span><span><span>年。</span></span></span></span><span><span>2001-2003</span></span><span><span><span><span>年，由原中国科学院遗传研究所、发育生物学研究所及石家庄农业现代化研究所整合而成。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span>遗传发育所以全面实现“四个率先”为目标，面向我国农业和人口健康重大战略需求，聚焦智慧育种、生态健康农业和代谢稳态与干<span></span>预三大方向开展攻关，突破遗传与发育生物学领域重要前沿理论和关键技术，实现科学技术跨越发展，在国家现代农业和人口健康科技创新体系中发挥骨干和引领作用，成为遗传与发育生物学原始创新研究基地、高新技术研发基地、国家创新人才高地、优秀人才培养基地，实现对国际著名机构的赶超，进入国际领先的一流科研机构行列。</span></p><p><span><span><span><span>研究所设有种子创新全国重点实验室、育种前沿技术实验室、整合生理调控实验室、零一创新中心、农业资源研究中心（单独招生）</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>个研究单元，有中国科学院院士</span></span></span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span><span><span>人、国家杰出青年科学基金获得者</span></span></span></span><span><span>24</span></span><span><span><span><span>人，国家优秀青年科学基金获得者</span></span></span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span><span><span>人，新基石研究员</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>人。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>目前，研究所拥有神经生物学、遗传学、发育生物学、细胞生物学、生物信息学、生物物理学、作物学、植物营养学、生态学（由农业资源研究中心独立招生）等</span></span></span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span><span><span>个硕士、博士学位培养点，生物与医药、农学（由农业资源研究中心独立招生）等</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>个专业学位硕士培养点，可招收直博生、推荐免试硕士生、统考硕士生、普通招考博士生。建所至今，已累计培养研究生</span></span></span></span><span><span>2200</span></span><span><span><span><span>余名（其中博士生</span></span></span></span><span><span>1700</span></span><span><span><span><span>余名）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年，遗传发育所拟于</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月中旬举办 “筑梦科学”大学生夏令营活动，欢迎有意向报考中国科学院遗传发育所的</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生报名参加。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>一、活动时间及形式：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1. 2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>14</span></span><span><span><span><span>日——</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>18</span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span><span><span>线下参加</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>二、参加人数： </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>120</span></span><span><span><span><span>人左右</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>三、活动内容：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>遗传发育所概况及研究生培养情况介绍、专家学术报告、实验室和科研平台参观、师生交流、优秀营员选拔等活动，具体内容将在申请通过后另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>四、申请条件</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span><span><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱科学事业，道德品质良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span><span><span>生命科学类、医学类、农学类、化学类、物理学类和计算机类等学科背景的</span></span></span></span><span><span>2026</span></span><span><span><span><span>届本科毕业生。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><span><span>．诚实守信，品行端正，学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>．申请人在大学本科阶段学习成绩优异（一般应是专业综合排名前</span></span></span></span><span><span>30%</span></span><span><span><span><span>），有较好的科研潜力，具有较强的调查研究、分析问题、解决问题能力。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>5. </span></span><span><span><span><span>外国语程度良好，具有较强的外语听、说、读、写能力，大学英语四级≥</span></span></span></span><span><span>500</span></span><span><span><span><span>分或英语六级≥</span></span></span></span><span><span>450</span></span><span><span><span><span>分者优先。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>．身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>五、申请方式</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>报名时间：</span></span><span><span>即日起至</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>25</span></span><span><span><span><span>日。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>申请方式：</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>通过中国科学院大学夏令营网报系统申报。请申请人登录“科教结合协同育人行动计划”网站（</span></span></span></span><a href=\"http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/</span></span></a><span><span><span><span>），进入“</span></span><span><span>大学生夏令营报名入口</span></span><span><span>”，注册后，选择</span></span><span><span>“筑梦科学”大学生夏令营——遗传与发育生物学研究所</span></span><span><span>，点击“</span></span><span><span>我要报名</span></span><span><span>”。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>报名回执：</span></span></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://genetics.cas.cn/edu/zsxx/xlytms/202504/W020250424580682866439.jpg\"/></p><p><span><span><span><span>回执链接：</span></span></span></span><a href=\"https://www.wjx.cn/vm/PiMjEVW.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://www.wjx.cn/vm/PiMjEVW.aspx#</span></span></a></p><p><span><span><span><span>申请者完成网报系统申报后，扫码或点击回执链接填写报名回执信息方可视为报名成功。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>报名截止后，研究所将组织专家对申请者进行筛选并确定正式入选的名单。名单拟于</span></span></span></span><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span><span>日前后在“遗传发育所研究生教育”网站内公布并邮件通知本人；未入选者不再另行通知。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>六、其他事宜</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span><span>为外地学员提供在京的住宿（京区学生原则上不提供住宿，将给予相应的交通补贴）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span><span>请自行预订往返车票，研究所提供适当的交通和生活补贴。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span><span>研究所将为学生购买在京期间人身意外伤害保险，报到时需签署安全协议。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>七、联系方式</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联 系 人：贾老师、张老师</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></span></span><span><span>010-64806523/6522</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>邮 箱：</span></span></span></span><span><span><a href=\"mailto:yzb@genetics.ac.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>yzb@genetics.ac.cn</span></span></a></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>地 址：北京市朝阳区北辰西路</span></span></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><span><span>号院</span></span></span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span><span>号</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span></span></span><span><span><span><span>中国科学院遗传与发育生物学研究所研究生部</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>邮 编：</span></span></span></span><span><span>100101</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span><span>中国科学院遗传与发育生物学研究所研究生部 </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>2025</span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span><span><span>24</span></span><span><span><span><span>日          </span></span></span></span></p><p></p></div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<hr/>\n<p>附件下载：</p>\n<ul>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n</div>","textSha256":"0825b8031c787ac32fad1a6c8576d8615983640fcfd7bba70071c4238016ec9e","textLength":1711,"sourceSha256":"ecd664bc9e0645a54e60a505e0d3d8df608b5ed368e51d365f61063ae3c21182","selector":"article-like:details-page","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-11dbd06efbdd205307fc","title":"2025年中国科学院遗传与发育生物学研究所2025年“筑梦科学”大学生夏令营活动报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:00.886818+00:00"}
